  curtismbeard@gmail.com

Modifications in this fork (IcedAstroGrep) include:
  - Retarget to .NET 10 (net10.0-windows)
  - SDK-style projects and PackageReference
  - Portable-only distribution (no installer, no Explorer context menu)
  - Light theme only
  - Cooperative search cancellation (CancellationToken instead of Thread.Abort)
  - Encoding cache serialization without BinaryFormatter


