Other libraries
---------------
The application also depends on NuGet packages, each under its own license: AvalonEdit,
CommandLineParser, DocumentFormat.OpenXml, ExcelDataReader, ExcelNumberFormat, NLog,
System.Text.Encoding.CodePages and TagLibSharp. Their license texts are distributed inside the
packages themselves; see the package entries in IcedAstroGrep.App.csproj.

The Mozilla Universal Charset Detector port under src/IcedAstroGrep.Core/EncodingDetection/Ude is
covered by the license block at the top of each of its source files (MPL 1.1 / GPL 2.0 / LGPL 2.1).
